"investigators) by name or institution. Returns unique depositor names "
"with their plasmid counts and example plasmids. At least one of name or "
"institution is required. Requires ADDGENE\\_API\\_KEY environment "
"variable. Use for: finding plasmids from a specific lab, browsing "
"depositor contributions."
msgstr ""

