#: ../../tools/addgene_tools.rst:104 9a8d98f1e7f04b9e9ff3b92ed718fb0f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Addgene's plasmid catalog by name, gene, species,"
" or vector type. Addgene is a nonprofit global plasmid repository with "
"100,000+ plasmids. Returns plasmid name, ID, purpose, depositor, genes, "
"species, vector types, and expression systems. Requires "
"ADDGENE\\_API\\_KEY environment variable. Use for: finding CRISPR "
"plasmids, AAV vectors, expression constructs, shRNA libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/addgene_tools.rst:111 9b199daee6154b988206a381b1ea6c29
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Plasmid name or keyword to search (e.g., "
"'pSpCas9', 'GFP', 'lentiviral'). Searches the name field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/addgene_tools.rst:114 b8dc6d382a0f414ca49cab00b6a1c550
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by organism/species (e.g., "
"'Human', 'Mouse', 'E. coli'). Maps to the species field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/addgene_tools.rst:117 207832c8ef2a4fa2b8b591491dbe1253
msgid ""
"``vector_type`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by vector type (e.g., "
"'AAV', 'Lentiviral', 'Retroviral', 'Mammalian Expression'). Maps to "
"vector\\_types field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/addgene_tools.rst:120 8100a0e5c3974dbf89892f7092fe9b9c
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(default 10, max 100)"
msgstr ""

